# Integrate @@FEATURE@@

This is a small UI-only library. No repository or domain layer is justified yet.
For an existing app prefer its feature pattern and adapt the generated files.

For the suite starter, generate into `feature-@@FEATURE@@`, add
`include(":feature-@@FEATURE@@")` to settings and
`implementation(project(":feature-@@FEATURE@@"))` to the app dependencies.
Align minSdk/compileSdk with the host and wire the screen through the existing
navigation graph. The generated module compiles independently but is not routed
automatically. Run its unit tests and the host's compile/lint checks after wiring.
